---
layout: base.njk
title: "Candor Digital | Honest Digital Marketing Agency in Melbourne"
ogTitle: "Candor Digital"
description: "Candor Digital is a Melbourne digital marketing agency for small businesses: social media management, Meta ads, email marketing and websites, with plain-English reporting. Month-to-month, no lock-in. Free 30-minute audit."
bodyClass: "page-home"
homeFaqIdx: [7, 6, 0, 10]
---
  <header class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="blob blob-1"></span>
      <span class="blob blob-2"></span>
      <span class="blob blob-3"></span>
      <svg class="grain" width="100%" height="100%"><filter id="noise"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.85" numOctaves="2" stitchTiles="stitch"/></filter><rect width="100%" height="100%" filter="url(#noise)"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow reveal" data-reveal>
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Melbourne digital marketing agency
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero-title" id="heroTitle" aria-label="Marketing that tells you the truth.">
          <span class="line"><span class="word">Marketing</span> <span class="word">that</span> <span class="word">tells</span></span>
          <span class="line"><input type="text" id="brandInput" class="hero-input word" value="you" placeholder="you" maxlength="24" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="words" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Type your brand's name to personalize this headline" data-hover> <span class="word word-em">the&nbsp;truth.</span></span>
        </h1>
        <button type="button" class="hero-hint reveal" id="brandHint" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.38s"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.1 2.1 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4z"/></svg><span>Tap <b>&ldquo;you&rdquo;</b> and type your business name</span></button>
        <p class="hero-sub reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.15s">Candor Digital helps <span id="heroSubBrand">small, ambitious brands</span> grow online — with plain answers, honest reporting, and results you can check yourself, not numbers dressed up to look good.</p>
        <ul class="hero-trust reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.2s"><li>Month-to-month</li><li>Ad spend never marked up</li><li>You own every account</li></ul>
        <div class="hero-ctas reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.25s">
          <a class="btn btn-primary magnetic" href="#quickForm" data-hover data-track="hero_cta"><span id="heroCtaText">Book a free 30-min audit</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary magnetic" href="/services/" data-hover><span>See what we do</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-form-card reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.1s">
        <div class="hfc-head">
          <span class="hfc-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div><b>Book a free 30-minute audit</b><span>Reply within one business day</span></div>
        </div>
        <ul class="hfc-gets">
          <li>An honest look at your socials, site and ads</li>
          <li>What to fix first, in plain English</li>
          <li>A written summary, whether you hire us or not</li>
        </ul>
        <form class="quick-form" name="quick-audit" method="POST" action="/thanks/" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company_website" id="quickForm">
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="quick-audit">
          <p class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave this empty <input name="company_website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p>
          <div class="field-row">
            <label class="field"><span>Name <em aria-hidden="true">*</em></span><input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label>
            <label class="field"><span>Business</span><input type="text" name="business" autocomplete="organization"></label>
          </div>
          <label class="field"><span>Email <em aria-hidden="true">*</em></span><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
          <label class="field"><span>Phone</span><input type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="04XX XXX XXX"></label>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary magnetic" data-hover><span>Book my free audit</span></button>
          <p class="form-note muted">No obligation. We only use your details to reply.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-cue reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.4s">
      <span>Scroll</span>
      <div class="scroll-cue-line"></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="marquee-track">
      <span>Social Media</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span>
      <span>Meta Ads</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span>
      <span>Email Marketing</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span>
      <span>Websites</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span>
      <span>Social Media</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span>
      <span>Meta Ads</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span>
      <span>Email Marketing</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span>
      <span>Websites</span><span class="dot">&middot;</span>
    </div>
  </div>


  <section id="who" class="home-block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">who we help</span></div>
        <h2>Built for small businesses that sell on trust</h2>
        <p class="muted">Owner-led businesses without a marketing team, who want someone to do the work and explain it plainly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="who-grid">
        <article class="who-card reveal" data-reveal><span class="who-num">New</span><h3>Brands just getting started</h3><p>A credible website, a social presence and first campaigns that bring in early customers.</p><a class="card-more" href="/services/websites/" data-hover>Start with a website <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></article>
        <article class="who-card reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.06s"><span class="who-num">Local</span><h3>Service businesses in Melbourne</h3><p>Cafes, salons, clinics and trades who need steady enquiries from people nearby.</p><a class="card-more" href="/services/meta-ads/" data-hover>Local Meta ads <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></article>
        <article class="who-card reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.12s"><span class="who-num">Trust</span><h3>Brokers, advisers and personal brands</h3><p>People whose business is their name, who need content and a site that builds trust fast.</p><a class="card-more" href="/services/social-media/" data-hover>Content that builds trust <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="services" class="home-block alt-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">what we actually do</span></div>
        <h2>Four services, done properly</h2>
        <p class="muted">A short list on purpose. Every service comes with plain-English reporting and month-to-month terms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards">
        {% set icons = {
          "Social media management": '<path d="M4 5h16v11H8l-4 4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 12h5"/>',
          "Meta ads": '<path d="M3 11l15-6v14L3 13z"/><path d="M7 13v5h3"/>',
          "Email marketing": '<rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/>',
          "Websites": '<rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18M8 4v5"/>'
        } %}
        {% for s in collections.service %}
        <article class="card tilt reveal" data-reveal data-tilt style="transition-delay:{{ loop.index0 * 0.06 }}s">
          <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">{{ icons[s.data.service] | safe }}</svg></span>
          <h3>{{ s.data.service }}</h3>
          <p>{{ s.data.short }}</p>
          <ul class="mini-list">{% for i in s.data.included | batch(3) | first %}<li>{{ i.t }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          <a class="card-more" href="{{ s.url }}" data-hover>{{ s.data.service }} <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="why" class="home-block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">why candor</span></div>
        <h2>Four rules we don&rsquo;t bend</h2>
        <p class="muted">We&rsquo;re new and small on purpose, so we compete on honesty and attention, not awards.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principles">
        <article class="principle reveal" data-reveal><h3>Ad spend is never marked up</h3><p>Billed straight to your card. Our fee is the only thing we invoice.</p></article>
        <article class="principle reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.06s"><h3>You own every account</h3><p>Ads, pixels, analytics and content stay in your name.</p></article>
        <article class="principle reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.12s"><h3>Reports you can read</h3><p>One page plus a five-minute video, every month.</p></article>
        <article class="principle reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.18s"><h3>A short client list</h3><p>The person running your audit is the person doing the work.</p></article>
      </div>
      <p class="section-more"><a href="/about/" data-hover>Read our story <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="process" class="home-block alt-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">how it really starts</span></div>
        <h2>Four steps, not a funnel</h2>
        <p class="muted">You see real numbers before you commit to anything longer than a month.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="steps-row">
        <li class="reveal" data-reveal><b>Free audit</b><span>30 minutes, honest verdict</span></li>
        <li class="reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.06s"><b>4-week trial</b><span>One channel, clearly scoped</span></li>
        <li class="reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.12s"><b>Plain report</b><span>Numbers vs what we promised</span></li>
        <li class="reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.18s"><b>You decide</b><span>Continue, change or walk away</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="section-more"><a href="/services/#process" data-hover>See the full process <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="work" class="home-block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">proof, not promises</span></div>
        <h2>Real projects, built end to end</h2>
        <p class="muted">No invented numbers. Just what we built and what&rsquo;s live right now.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="work-preview">
        {% for c in collections.case %}
        <a class="shot-card reveal" data-reveal href="{{ c.url }}" data-hover>
          <span class="shot-frame"><img src="{{ c.data.shot }}" alt="{{ c.data.shotAlt }}" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="667"></span>
          <span class="shot-meta"><b>{{ c.data.client }}</b><span>{{ c.data.cardLine }}</span></span>
          <span class="shot-tags">{% for t in c.data.servicesUsed %}<i>{{ t }}</i>{% endfor %}</span>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="section-more"><a href="/work/" data-hover>See all work <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="pricing" class="home-block alt-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">the number, up front</span></div>
        <h2>Simple pricing, no lock-in</h2>
        <p class="muted">{{ pricing.note }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="price-mini">
        {% for p in pricing.packages %}
        <a class="price-chip reveal{% if p.featured %} is-featured{% endif %}" data-reveal href="/pricing/" data-hover><b>{{ p.name }}</b><span class="pc-price">{{ p.price }} <small>{{ p.per }}</small></span><span class="pc-line">{{ p.line }}</span></a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="section-more"><a href="/pricing/" data-hover>See what&rsquo;s included in each <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="faq" class="faq home-block">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" data-reveal>
        <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">asked &amp; answered</span></div>
        <h2>Quick answers</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="accordion">
        {% for i in homeFaqIdx %}{% set f = generalFaqs[i] %}
        <div class="accordion-item reveal" data-reveal>
          <button class="accordion-trigger" data-hover aria-expanded="false"><span>{{ f.q }}</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="accordion-icon"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"/></svg></button>
          <div class="accordion-panel"><p>{{ f.a }}</p></div>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="section-more"><a href="/contact/#faq" data-hover>All questions <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

{% include "cta-band.njk" %}
